Just install it and report if it works or doesn't work.

BTW to automatically boot multiuser you just change the boot_osflags in
SRM like described on http://www.netbsd.org/Ports/alpha/faq.html#multiuser-boot
>>> set boot_osflags a
Or when booting
>>> boot -fl a


